vllm.json is the reference Grafana dashboard from the vLLM project
(examples/observability/prometheus_grafana/grafana.json), changed for this
recipe: every query is filtered by app and a Machine (replica) variable, and
latency, throughput, scheduler and cache panels draw one line per machine.

